size 100 10
start
keys <Tab> j <CR>
keys <Tab> <Tab> j <CR>
keys o
type Call
keys <CR>
frame a-frame
cursor a-cursor
type Mail
keys <CR>
keys <Esc>
frame b-frame
file todo.txt a-file
-- config.toml --
keep_adding = true
show_detail = false
-- todo.txt --
A +work @phone
B +home
C +work @phone
-- a-frame --
┌[3]─Projects─┐┌ [1]─+work  @phone ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ +home    1/1││  2       A                                                           +work @phone │
│>+work    3/3││  1       Call                                                        +work @phone │
├[4]─Contexts─┤│     +work @phone                                                                  │
│>@phone   3/3││  1       C                                                           +work @phone │
├[5]─Filters──┤│                                                                                   │
│ [x] Done    ││                                                                                   │
│ [ ] Later   ││                                                                                   │
└─────────────┘└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 INSERT  todo.txt  manual  2 added: Call  <CR> commit  <C-c> cancel
-- a-cursor --
├[4]─Contexts─┤│     +work @phone                                                                  │
                    ^
-- b-frame --
┌[3]─Projects─┐┌ [1]─+work  @phone ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ +home    1/1││  2       A                                                           +work @phone │
│>+work    4/4││  1       Call                                                        +work @phone │
├[4]─Contexts─┤│  3       Mail                                                        +work @phone │
│>@phone   4/4││  1       C                                                           +work @phone │
├[5]─Filters──┤│                                                                                   │
│ [x] Done    ││                                                                                   │
│ [ ] Later   ││                                                                                   │
└─────────────┘└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  x done  t state  o new  a append  dd delete  u undo  / search  ? help
